          <strong>Restaurante Praia da Luz</strong>
        </a>
        - This restaurant is on the pricier side, largely because you’re paying for the beachfront setting and the sunset views. 
        If you go, make a reservation or time your visit for sunset, and try to sit on the upper outdoor deck. 
        Sitting outside on the upper deck at sunset is the main reason to go. 
        To turn it into an evening, walk there along the Foz promenade, stopping for drinks or small bites at a few places along the way.
      </p>
      
